WEBVTT

01:00:29.913 --> 01:00:32.246
And kind of like the central
learning of my career,

01:00:32.246 --> 01:00:36.413
why I individual startups has been
that if you really scale them up,

01:00:36.746 --> 01:00:40.621
remarkable things can happen. And I.

01:00:43.288 --> 01:00:47.288
I did it and I was like, one of the things
that would make this exciting

01:00:47.288 --> 01:00:50.871
for me personally motivating would
be if I could sort of push it in

01:00:50.871 --> 01:00:55.829
the direction of doing these hard tech
companies, one of which became open.

01:00:55.871 --> 01:00:57.579
I describe actually

01:00:57.579 --> 01:00:59.621
what Y Combinator is, you know,

01:00:59.704 --> 01:01:03.246
how many people come through it to give
us a couple of stories of its impact.